+/*
+ * UTF-8 DFA decoder by Bjoern Hoehrmann.
+ * Copyright (c) 2008-2010 Bjoern Hoehrmann <bjoern@hoehrmann.de>
+ * See https://github.com/polijan/utf8_decode for details.
+ *
+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
